      "entries": [
        "The sun warrior swings their weapon with a sweeping spin. They attempt separate Athletics checks to Trip any number of creatures within their reach. Each attempt counts toward the sun warrior's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after they make all the attacks."
      ],
      "frequency": {
        "number": 1,
        "unit": "round",
        "text": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pinning Thrust",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 2,
        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The sun warrior attempts to drive their spear through a foe to pin them in place. The sun warrior makes a spear Strike. On a hit, the target's clothes, armor, or other piece of equipment becomes pinned to the ground. The sun warrior Releases the spear, and the target is immobilized until they can remove the spear (Escape DC 27). If the Strike was a critical hit, the DC increases by 2."
      ]
    }
